# Normalise to LF in the repository. Checked out native on Windows, so
# working copies are unaffected — this only stops the diff of a file
# edited on a Mac and a PC being the whole file.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, and not to be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary

# The lockfile is generated. Collapsing it in reviews keeps a real
# change visible next to it.
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true -diff
